                ["Technique", "What it shows", "Best for"],
                ["Basic flowchart", "Steps, decisions and order", "Simple processes with one owner, or explaining logic"],
                ["Swimlane diagram", "Steps, order and who does each step", "Processes that cross teams, with handoffs and approvals"],
