            "Among the [project management tools](/project-management-tools/) we review, several support this work. [Wrike](/project-management-tools/wrike/), our top-rated tool, is a good fit once the diagram is agreed: its custom workflows, request forms and automation rules let you build the to-be process so requests arrive with the right information and move between owners automatically. Wrike Whiteboard is available as an add-on (included in the Apex plan) if you want to draw the diagram in the same place. [ClickUp](/project-management-tools/clickup/) includes Whiteboards on its plans, with limits on the lower tiers, and [Jira](/project-management-tools/jira/) supports swimlanes by assignee, epic or priority on its Kanban boards for software and IT teams.",
